16. Conformance

A Workflow Orchestration implementation conforms if it:

Coordinates canonical Workflow Instances.
Supports explicit dependencies.
Implements deterministic synchronization.
Supports event-driven coordination.
Preserves workflow autonomy.
Supports governed recovery.
Maintains orchestration traceability.
